sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent
    participant SliceManager
    participant SetupSubprocess
    participant Engineer
    Parent->>SliceManager: Start implementation slice
    SliceManager->>SetupSubprocess: Start solution setup if needed
    SetupSubprocess-->>SliceManager: Setup status and evidence
    SliceManager->>Engineer: Implement bounded change
    Engineer-->>SliceManager: Change set and test evidence
    SliceManager-->>Parent: Handoff blockers and proof
